{
  "uid": "logs-seguridad",
  "title": "Seguridad del servidor",
  "description": "Quién golpea el servidor y quién entró de verdad. Los datos salen de /var/log del host, recogidos por Alloy.",
  "tags": ["servidor", "seguridad"],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": false,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Lo que importa",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Contraseñas falladas (SSH)",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["sum"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto", "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "#E5A03D", "value": 20 },
              { "color": "#E5484D", "value": 100 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({origen=\"host\", job=\"ssh\"} |= \"Failed password\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Usuarios inventados (SSH)",
      "description": "Alguien probando nombres que no existen: admin, oracle, test… Es tanteo, no un error de quien sí tiene cuenta.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["sum"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto", "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "#E5A03D", "value": 10 },
              { "color": "#E5484D", "value": 50 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({origen=\"host\", job=\"ssh\"} |= \"Invalid user\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Sondas al escritorio remoto",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["sum"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto", "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "#E5A03D", "value": 20 },
              { "color": "#E5484D", "value": 100 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({origen=\"host\", job=\"rdp\"} |= \"connection accepted\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "ENTRARON (accesos correctos)",
      "description": "El único número de esta pantalla que puede significar que ya están dentro. Si no reconoces uno, cambia la contraseña.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["sum"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "auto", "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "#1FA971", "value": null },
              { "color": "#2F6BFF", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({origen=\"host\", job=\"ssh\"} |= \"Accepted \" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Accesos que SÍ funcionaron",
      "description": "Cada línea es alguien que entró. Comprueba la IP: si no es tuya, ya no es un intento.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true, "showLabels": false, "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true, "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true, "dedupStrategy": "none", "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "{origen=\"host\", job=\"ssh\"} |= \"Accepted \"",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Quién está llamando a la puerta",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Intentos por hora, por origen",
      "description": "Un pico aquí es un escaneo. Una línea plana y constante es un bot insistiendo.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 14, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 60, "lineWidth": 1, "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" } },
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "SSH · contraseña fallada",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({origen=\"host\", job=\"ssh\"} |= \"Failed password\" [1h]))",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "SSH · usuario inventado",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({origen=\"host\", job=\"ssh\"} |= \"Invalid user\" [1h]))",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "Escritorio remoto",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({origen=\"host\", job=\"rdp\"} |= \"connection accepted\" [1h]))",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Bloqueos de fail2ban",
      "description": "Cada línea es una IP que se pasó de la raya y quedó fuera. Que esto tenga movimiento es buena señal: significa que algo está frenando.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 10, "x": 14, "y": 15 },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true, "showLabels": false, "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true, "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true, "dedupStrategy": "none", "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "{origen=\"host\", job=\"fail2ban\"} |~ \"Ban |Unban \"",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Todo lo del host, en crudo",
      "description": "SSH, escritorio remoto, fail2ban y cortafuegos juntos. Para cuando ya sabes qué buscas.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 23 },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true, "showLabels": true, "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true, "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true, "dedupStrategy": "none", "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "{origen=\"host\"}",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
